        rawContent: "{{Person Information|\n|name =Arnold Stadt\n|image =\n|caption =\n|birth_date =October 19, [[2279]]\n|birth_place =[[Mesar]], [[Centus System]]\n|death_date =\n|death_place =\n|allegiance =[[United Centusi States]]\n|profession =Military Leader\n|recognitions =\n|achievements =\n}}\n\n''Arnold Stadt'' is one of the fiercest and most brilliant [[Mesarthrim]] commanders. He served the [[United Mesarthrim Clans]], then the [[United Centusi States]] after the Clans failed.\n\n[[Category:People]]\n[[Category:Mesarthrim]]\n[[Category:People of the United Mesarthrim Clans]]\n[[Category:People of the United Centusi States]]\n[[Category:Military Leaders]]"
