        images: undefined,
        rawContent: "{{Person Information|\n|name =Blasius Greg\u00f6ri J\u00e1nos\n|image =\n|caption =\n|birth_date =August 17, [[2276]]\n|birth_place =[[Kirtszi]], [[Sirius Novgorod System]]\n|death_date =\n|death_place =\n|allegiance =[[Sirius Families]]\n|profession =Political Leader\n|recognitions =\n|achievements =\n}}\n\n'''Blasius Greg\u00f6ri J\u00e1nos''', known as \"Greg Blasius\" or \"Gregor Blasius\" in English-speaking communities, is the hereditary head of the [[Blasius Family Territory]] and the [[Blasius \u00e1llam-Neh\u00e9zipar]], or \"Blasius State Industries.\"\n\n[[Category:People]]"
